WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
Nivlet’s native Prompts panel shows six reusable prompts in the Design project sample pocket.

00:04.000 --> 00:06.000
The Explain a concept template opens. It has Topic and Audience blanks and a complete-text preview.

00:06.000 --> 00:10.000
Topic is filled with “design systems” and Audience with “a new teammate”. The native preview updates while typing.

00:10.000 --> 00:14.000
Both fields are filled. The complete prompt is visible and Copy prompt is available. No copy or send action is performed.

00:14.000 --> 00:17.000
The References tool shows a layout image and a page brief. Both are synthetic bundled samples.

00:17.000 --> 00:20.000
Scratchpad shows next questions and three checklist rows, including a completed task.

00:20.000 --> 00:21.400
The panel returns to Prompts. This is an isolated Debug preview on a real Mac, recorded without audio.
